{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203440","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320344001:1":{"text":"デューラ様に感謝……リュボミル様、私たちを助けてくださるのですね！？","source_cn":"艾雅在上……艺术家先生，您是愿意帮我这个忙了吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B72B58233E4B0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320344002:1":{"text":"絵を完成させることはできないが、別の方法で協力しよう。","source_cn":"我不能补全这幅画，但可以用另一种方式帮你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057559A8E9450752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320344003:1":{"text":"借金がいくらあるのかは分からないが、この絵を五倍の値段で買い取る。小さな荘園を買えるぐらいの額にはなるはずだ。","source_cn":"我不知道你欠了多少债，但我会用五倍的价格买下这幅画。这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046CD17581C84A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320344004:1":{"text":"ご、五倍！？リュボミルさん、お金持ち……","source_cn":"五——五倍的价格！柳博米尔好有钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x627A69ED3BA20D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1320344004":{"text":"ご、五倍！？リュボミルさん、お金持ち……","source_cn":"五——五倍的价格！柳博米尔好有钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x627A69ED3BA20D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl